Just another lab.

--- RUN ---
Open PowerShell and navigate to the root directory of `ai-dev-companion`.

BACKEND
Run `docker compose up`
Run `./mvnw spring-boot:run`

AI
Open PowerShell.
Run `ollama pull all-minilm`

FRONTEND
Open PowerShell.
Navigate to the `frontend` directory.
Run `npm run dev`

--- TEST ---
AI
To test that Ollama is running:
Run `Invoke-RestMethod -Uri http://localhost:11434/api/tags`. The response should be a JSON object.
